#. module: grc_backbone
#: model_terms:x_grc.sop,x_procedure_steps:grc_backbone.sop_external_governance_renewal
msgid ""
"1. Check expiry date and renewal window.\n"
"2. Collect supporting documents.\n"
"3. Submit to the competent authority and record references.\n"
"4. Archive the renewed copies and notify the record owner."
msgstr ""

#. module: grc_backbone
#: model_terms:x_grc.sop,x_procedure_steps:grc_backbone.sop_site_supply_replenishment
msgid ""
"1. Verify plant consumption and minimum stock.\n"
"2. Raise the replenishment request and confirm supplier availability.\n"
"3. Coordinate delivery and on-site receipt.\n"
"4. Record the delivery evidence and close the cycle."
msgstr ""

